          {
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "TRAIN: Gain stats\nso that she can\nwin the 3 races",
                "that will complete\nher career.",
                "REST: Low energy\nreduces training\nsuccess rates,",
                "so make sure your\ntrainee gets her\nrest!",
                "REC: Take her on\nsome recreational\nactivities to",
                "boost her mood and\nfor other bonuses.",
                "RACE: Each trainee\nhas a different\nset of 3 races to",
                "complete(sprint,\nmile, medium,\nlong, and dirt).",
                "However, no need\nto worry, as there\nis no time limit.",
                "MENU: SAVE your\ngame and see your\nSTATS."
